<html>
<head>
	<title></title>
</head>
<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},<br />
<br />
Thank you for contacting the Qantas Customer Care team about your journey to {{{Case.Arrival_City__c}}} on {{{Case.Email_Arrival_Date_Time__c}}}. I’m sorry to hear about the impact the schedule change had on your planned itinerary.<br />
<br />
<em><strong>-If staff were rude add:-</strong></em><br />
<br />
I'm also sorry to hear about the way this situation was handled by our staff. Your experience matters to us, and while our team may have limited options in certain situations, you should always expect to receive helpful and courteous service.<br />
<br />
<strong>Things don’t always go to plan</strong><br />
<br />
While we’re committed to getting you to your destination on time, on occasion, flight changes are necessary. We do our best to avoid them wherever possible, and I understand how inconvenient schedule changes are.<br />
<br />
We know how important it is to let you know when changes happen. We sent you an email on &lt;date&gt; advising you of the change. While we will do our best to provide you with clear and timely announcements, I’m sorry that on this occasion we didn’t quite meet your expectations.<br />
<br />
<strong><em>-If asking why add:-</em></strong><br />
<br />
Our scheduling process is influenced by a wide range of operational factors, including &nbsp;aircraft maintenance, the commercial viability of routes, seasonal adjustments, special events, as well as changes to codeshare arrangements with our partners.<br />
<br />
Since each aircraft in our fleet serves multiple routes, any adjustment can ripple across our entire network, making it challenging to pinpoint a specific reason for each schedule change.<br />
<br />
We appreciate your understanding as we work hard to keep our services efficient and reliable.<br />
<br />
<em><strong>-If requesting compensation add: </strong></em>-<br />
<br />
<strong>We’re here to help&nbsp;</strong><br />
<br />
As you were provided notification within a reasonable timeframe, unfortunately I’m unable to meet your request for a refund for your unexpected expenses.<br />
<br />
Please let me know if you’d like me to provide you with an insurance letter to assist with a claim.</body>
</html>